      "title": "可选巩固题｜需要时再做",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "可选巩固题｜需要时再做",
          "style": "Heading3",
          "sourceIndex": 173
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "1. A=[-1,3]，B=(1,5)，求A∩B。",
          "style": "",
          "sourceIndex": 174
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "2. A=(-∞,2)，B=[0,4]，求A∪B。",
          "style": "",
          "sourceIndex": 175
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "3. U={1,2,3,4,5}，A={1,3,5}，求U中A的补集。",
          "style": "",
          "sourceIndex": 176
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "4. A={x|x²<4}，求A。",
          "style": "",
          "sourceIndex": 177
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "5. A={1,2,2,3}，A中元素个数。",
          "style": "",
          "sourceIndex": 178
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "答案速查：1.(1,3]；2.(-∞,4]；3.{2,4}；4.(-2,2)；5.3",
          "style": "TinyNote",
          "sourceIndex": 179
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "—  本题型到这里。下次卡住直接搜 SOP 编号或题型名。  —",
          "style": "",
          "sourceIndex": 180
        }
      ]
    }
